  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposal, by reason of the site being located within an area of land liable to flooding and the lack of a comprehensive Flood Risk Assessment , due to a lack of flood maps and flood mitigation measures&amp;nbsp;which take into account the depth of the flood and its siting adjacent to an ordinary watercourse and&amp;nbsp; insufficient information for the protection of the ordinary watercourse,&amp;nbsp;has failed to demonstrate that the proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies SI12 and SI13 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and Policies DM 9, DM 10 and DM 11 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
